UMBRA END USER LICENSE AGREEMENT

This software ("UMBRA", comprising the desktop assistant and the Android
launcher) is licensed, not sold, to you by the publisher under the terms
below.

1. FREEMIUM TIERS
   - LITE: free of charge. Includes the core assistant (chat, voice,
     memory, reminders, health logging and screening, /look, avatar).
   - PRO: unlocked by a signed license key purchased from the publisher.
     Adds screen control, the Bridge (remote agent), the Portal (XR),
     the Watchtower, and live vision. Keys are Ed25519-signed, may be
     perpetual or time-limited, and are issued per customer.

2. YOUR RIGHTS
   - Install and use LITE on any number of your own devices, free of
     charge, for personal use.
   - Install and use PRO on devices you own or control, per the license
     key issued to you.

3. YOU MAY NOT
   - Redistribute, sell, sublicense, or publish the software or a PRO
     license key.
   - Circumvent the license validation or the safety gates.
   - Use the software to provide a competing hosted service.

4. OWNERSHIP
   The software is licensed, not sold. The publisher retains all rights,
   title and interest.

5. DATA AND PRIVACY
   The software is local-first: your license, memories, health samples and
   reminders are stored on your device. Vision frames and prompts are sent
   only to the AI provider YOU configure, with YOUR key. The publisher
   receives nothing.

6. HEALTH DISCLAIMER
   The health screening features are informational heuristics against your
   own recorded baseline. They are not medical advice, not a diagnosis,
   and not a medical device. Consult a qualified physician for any
   health concern.

7. VOICE AND SPEECH
   Speech recognition and text-to-speech use the platform engines
   configured on your device.

8. NO WARRANTY
